      "section": "Cohort",
      "order": 2,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "Fisher's classic 150-flower dataset across three varieties (*Setosa*, *Versicolor*, *Virginica*), 50 of each. The four cards below count the cohort and say how finely it was measured \u2014 petal width takes only 22 distinct values across 150 flowers, which is why it discretises so cleanly. Filters on the left refine every tile.",
      "wf_tag": "python/iris_workflow"
    },
